      {"t":"type","p":"Today I work at home. (start with heute)","a":["Heute arbeite ich zu Hause.","Heute arbeite ich zuhause."],"hint":"heute · arbeiten · zu Hause","x":["arbeitet"],"why":"Verb second: heute first, then arbeite, then ich."},
      {"t":"type","p":"It's raining today.","a":["Es regnet heute.","Heute regnet es."],"hint":"regnen · heute · es","x":["regnen"],"why":"The verb is the second element either way: Es regnet heute, or Heute regnet es."}
