      {"t":"type","p":"Do you speak English? (formal)","a":["Sprechen Sie Englisch?"],"hint":"sprechen · Sie · Englisch","x":["sprichst"],"why":"Yes/no question: the verb comes first, in the Sie form: sprechen."},
      {"t":"type","p":"What are you doing? (to a friend)","a":["Was machst du?","Was tust du?"],"hint":"was · machen · du","x":["macht"],"why":"The du form ends in -st: machst, right after was."}
