      {"t":"type","p":"We're buying the jacket","a":["Wir kaufen die Jacke.","Die Jacke kaufen wir."],"hint":"kaufen · die Jacke","x":["kauft"],"why":"Jacke is feminine, so die stays die, and kaufen matches the subject wir."},
      {"t":"type","p":"Do you have a brother? (to a friend)","a":["Hast du einen Bruder?"],"hint":"haben · der Bruder · use ein-","x":["ein","hat"],"why":"Bruder is masculine and the direct object: einen Bruder; the du form is hast."}
